                textAlign: TextAlign.center,
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 10),
              Text(
                "L'ÃƒÂ©quipe $winnerTeam a gagnÃƒÂ© !",
                style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge?.copyWith(
                  color:
                      winnerTeam == 'Rouge'
                          ? Colors.redAccent
